extends layout

block content
  .row.banner
    .col-12
      h1= title
  .row
    .col-12.col-lg-8
      p Eye Contact: <br><br>
      ul
        li| A Rating of 1 - Speaker does not make eye contact with the audience.<br><br>
        li| A Rating of 2 - Speaker makes infrequent eye contact with the audience. <br><br>
        li| A Rating of 3 - Speaker makes frequent eye contact with some of the audience. <br><br> 
        li| A Rating of 4 - Speaker makes frequent eye contact with the whole audience. <br><br>
      p Gestures: <br><br>
      ul
        li| A Rating of 1 - No hand gestures are used. Speaker is stiff and unnatural. <br><br>
        li| A Rating of 2 - Speaker uses no hand gestures but is not stiff. <br><br>
        li| A Rating of 3 - Speaker uses some hand gestures but they do not seem fitting or natural. <br><br> 
        li| A Rating of 4 - Natural hand gestures are demonstrated throughout the presentation.<br><br>
             
      .col-12.col-md-12 
            